      Reservoir Inflow calculation based on an algorithm developed by NWP,
      Which utilizes storage change, releases, and additional outflows to calculate release
      based on the output time series duration.
    </Comment>
    <ExecClass>decodes.cwms.algo.InflowEstimationAlgo</ExecClass>
